Package: samo-radio
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: bouliehaan <debus.jacob@gmail.com>
Depends: ffmpeg, alsa-utils
Recommends: avahi-daemon
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/bouliehaan/samo-radio
Description: samo playback device for a machine's audio output
 Holds the sound card open and plays what samo-server tells it to, out of the
 box's own line-out. Tunes a samo channel or an internet radio station and
 stays there across reboots and network drops, and doubles as a cast target
 for "play to samo-radio" from the phone or the web UI.
 .
 Pairs from samo: RADIO -> SAMO-RADIO -> ADD DEVICE.
